    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mover><mi>C</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mover><mi>C</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mi>iii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Adding&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
